    "description": "Yuasa Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacturing, home building, environment building, and town building businesses in Japan. The company operates through Industrial Equipment & Tools; Machine Tools; Housing, Air & Fluidic Control Systems; Building Supplies & Exterior; Construction Machines; and Energy segments. It is involved in the sale of control equipment, logistics equipment, energy-saving equipment, and food processing machinery; industrial machinery, equipment, and automation equipment; piping materials, air conditioning equipment, housing equipment, and renewable energy-related equipment, and construction work, design supervision and contracting, real estate transactions; building materials, landscape, exterior, and civil engineering materials, and design and supervision of exterior material installation work; sales and leasing/rental of construction machinery and materials, prefabricated temporary housing; event setup furnishing business; and petroleum products. Yuasa Co., Ltd. was formerly known as Yuasa Trading Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Yuasa Co., Ltd. in April 2026. The company was founded in 1666 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
